    "author": "Gabe Rodriguez",
    "message": "Clement spent his first night with Alexandra in the post-delivery ward. The staff were super attentive and kind. Alexandra's first diaper change did draw some chuckles from the nurse when she put it on backwards, but recovered well 😅. Our Pastor just left after reading a blessing and praying for our new boy. Tests continue through tomorrow when we can checkout and go home. All good things 🙏"
