    "id": "f6d79ab8133db2befcbcca159c416809d5f0be40eec6398ca15f623e914996d1",
    "date": "2026-01-21T21:18:04.000Z",
    "author": "Gabe Rodriguez",
    "message": "After tested, pricked, and prodded for two days, Clement and Alexandra can finally come home. All of his assessments rendered great results. Given he is a big baby they had to do an extra set of glucose monitoring (via small pricks in his feet) to ensure he is eating enough for his size. His skin cleared up too! We also noticed he's starting to open his eyes for longer durations. Meeting eyes with Clement is such a special feeling.\n\nSo far he loves skin-on-skin time, but is not so happy when he lay him on his own. Looks like we'll need to ease into that 😅"
  },
